<title>EGYPT: Telemisr nine-month pre-tax at $3.71 mln.</title>
<headline>Telemisr nine-month pre-tax at $3.71 mln.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the end of the third quarter of the 1996/7 financial year which ends on June 30.</p>
<p>(All figures in Egyptian pounds, no comparative figures available)</p>
<p>				 July 1, 1996 - March 31, 1997</p>
<p> Net sales			    149,988,000</p>
<p> Production costs		   120,815,000</p>
<p> Overheads			     17,017,000</p>
<p> Exceptional revenues		   791,000</p>
<p> Exceptional expenditure		311,000</p>
<p> Net profit before tax	     12,636,000</p>
<p>Full company name is Telemisr/Arab Radio Transistor and Electronics Supplies.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
